      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb n="1" xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!-- Add later facs="egypt:UNKNOWN" -->
            <ab xml:id="MP2561_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>MRʿḤ <unclear reason="illegible" extent="1 word"/> <damage extent="1word"/>WNty <unclear reason="illegible" extent="1 word"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>PWN ʾlcʾnyk[yh] YḤWWNyt ʾwgwn ʾwbš
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>ʾy pldcytˈ ʾYK PWN hwtwhšʾn ʿL L
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>nʾmkˈ ʿḆYDWNty MRʿḤ ZK Y MŠLWNty
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP2561_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>xwadāy <unclear reason="illegible" extent="1 word"/> <damage extent="1word"/>ēd <unclear reason="illegible" extent="1 word"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>pad arzānīg[īh] bawēd ōwōn awiš
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ē pardazēd kū pad hutuxšān ō man
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>nāmag kunēd xwadāy ān ī čīnēd
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP2561_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Sir! <unclear reason="illegible" extent="1 word"/> <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>(if) it is in accordance with the value. So, <lb n="3–4" xml:id="trans-p1-l3-4"/> concerning that you may ensure that you write a letter to me by means of the scribes. Sir! That which he collects ...
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
